        {
          "text": "Lino bukali bwa-Jehova bwakabukila ba-Israyeli, aboobo wakabaaba mumaanza aa-Hazaeli mwami wa-Aramu amumaanza aa-Benihadadi mwana wa-Hazaeli mazuba oonse. ",
