        {
          "text": "Mpawo Jehoazi wakalibombya kubusyu bwa-Jehova, nkabela Jehova wakamuswiilila, nkaambo wakabona kuti ba-Israyeli balipengede, nkaambo mwami wa-Aramu wakali kubapenzya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
