        },
        {
          "text": "Lino makani amwi aa-Joasi, azyoonse nzyaakacita, anguzu zyakwe nzyaakalwisya Amaziya mwami wa-Juda, sa taalembedwe mubbuku lyamakani aaciindi aabami ba-Israyeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
