              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Joasi naakafwa, Jeroboamu nguwakalya bwami. Nkabela Joasi wakazikwa mu-Samariya antoomwe abami ba-Israyeli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
