        {
          "text": "Lino wakaambila mwami wa-Israyeli kuti, Bika ijanza lyako abuta. Elyo wakabika ijanza lyakwe alimbubo, alakwe Elisha wakabika maanza aakwe atala amaanza aamwami. ",
          "type": "text",
