                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi wakati, Amujalule impalangwizyo­ yakujwe. Bamane buyo kujalula, Elisha wakati, Fusa. Mpawo wakafusa, nkabela Elisha wakati, Ngooyu muvwi waluzundo lwa-Jehova, muvwi wakuzunda ba-Aramu, Uyookoma ba-Aramu mu-Afeki mane lumwi ukabamaninizye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
