        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi wakati, Bweza mivwi. Wakaibweza, Lino wakaambila mwami wa-Israyeli kuti, Iumye ansi. Wakaiumya ziindi zyotatwe, waleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
