              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo muntu wa-Leza wakamukalalila, wati, Weelede kuuma ziindi zyosanwe nanka ziindi zili musanu acimwi. Nowacita obo nowazunda ba-Aramu mane kubamaninizya, anukuti lino uyoobazunda ziindi zyotatwe buyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.19",
